QR Factorization Steps:
Given matrix A (size m x n)
1) Gram Schmidt Process
    q_1 = a_1 / ||a_1||
    q_2 = (m_2  - q_1 dot m_2 * q_1) / ||(m_2  - q_1 dot m_2 * q_1)||  ...
    q_n = a_n - sum(proj_q(a_n))
2) R = Q'A (where Q' is Q transpose)
3) c = Q'b
4) solve triangular system by back substution
    R_1 * x = R_1_1 * x_1 = c_1...


